Scroll containers: `overflow-y-auto` and `overflow-y-scroll`.

The compiler half of the core's scroll patch
(`crates/pocketjs-core/patches/0002-scroll.patch`): both classes set
`overflow` to the new `Overflow.Scroll`, which the core clips like
`overflow-hidden` and scrolls by a paint-only offset its host drives.
build-app.ts applies this to a staged copy of the PocketJS compiler, never to
the checkout.

